<div class="mandarin-hanzi">医院</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">yīyuàn</div>

''Meaning:'' hospital  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我昨天去医院看医生了。 — Wǒ zuótiān qù yīyuàn kàn yīshēng le. — I went to the hospital to see a doctor yesterday.

!! Usage note
A hospital is an 医院 (yīyuàn); 去医院 (qù yīyuàn) means 'go to the hospital', while 看医生 (kàn yīshēng) means 'see a doctor'.
